    "$t": "阿瑞 --ā話仙 - 白蟻"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《白蟻》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/藍春瑞</span></h2><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEilcNfMPqFeumZ6mYx_yqOZHX77WT1Gzo0HHcI3-pMAjRLECZE9exCC1UgawX_c_YwWl2kb-wWy_9hgc1OKLsLKmjvQ7Y7aypnxKRtx9QwSId3DCn0Xh08UzxFjSqlsIU3MD62Oz80EEaEsiBYuox_9npE7k3Kroj5MZrx3TFndDfEb9yxLVRFVyMTc3Shc\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEilcNfMPqFeumZ6mYx_yqOZHX77WT1Gzo0HHcI3-pMAjRLECZE9exCC1UgawX_c_YwWl2kb-wWy_9hgc1OKLsLKmjvQ7Y7aypnxKRtx9QwSId3DCn0Xh08UzxFjSqlsIU3MD62Oz80EEaEsiBYuox_9npE7k3Kroj5MZrx3TFndDfEb9yxLVRFVyMTc3Shc=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">白蟻是滿sì-kè lóng有ê蟲thuā，閒時看bē著伊ê影跡，m̄-koh厝前後壁有囥火柴iah是beh àu--去ê樹仔ue，倚著塗肉ê所在若kā徙tín動，伊就ē隨隻仔suan出來ngia̍uh-ngia̍uh趖，規陣e-e-kheh-kheh kah狗蟻tsiânn sio-siāng，khah無仝--ê是in頭大、色緻khah白。白蟻歹治，是伊bih tī柴內，無法度kā逐枝柴箍lóng破來揣ê緣故，koh再講伊bē kāng--人，kan-na無暝無日leh khè柴有淡薄仔顧人怨niâ，無人ē去tshap--in、揣in算siàu。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">白蟻tī舊曆7、8--月ê時tsūn，ē生翼變khah大sian，tī日頭tú-tsiah落山ê beh暗仔，一隻仔一隻bē講得濟，總爬爬--出-來，圍tī lâ-lûn燒koh光iànn-iànn ê電火跤iānn-iānn飛，一輾仔一輾leh se̍h-lin-long，像綿仔紙hiah薄ê翼ná飛ná lak，uè kah規塗跤滿滿是，賰肥軟bē飛ê身軀，親像狗蟻án-ne，phak tī塗跤爬來爬去。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">我íng過做囡仔ê時蹛tī製材所ê工寮，不時to拄著tsit款光景，工人lóng ē用面桶té水，tshāi踮電火跤承，suà--落-去一隻一隻家己輾--落-來，浮tī水面bo̍k-bo̍k泅，無偌久就總死tī內底，一面桶tīnn-tīnn，真正是有夠驚--人。Kám ē in飛出來見--人ê時tsūn，是熱--人上tsia̍p做風颱、淹大水ê流擺，iah是講in lóng tū死tī面桶水內底，tsiah號做「大水蝶仔」，就m̄是真知--ah。製材所ê工廠是柴起ê厝，柱仔、楹仔（ênn-á）、橫栱（huâinn-kông）lóng用家己liâu開ê便料，叫工人凊彩搭--ê，鋸好beh賣--人ê桷仔、枋仔是木材ê製品，連囥tī柴埕未liâu ê原木mā是tsiâu有柴味，白蟻無leh分芳臭，有柴就khînn來蛀，濟kah趕bē離，koh治bē斷根。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">工人iáu有一步趕白蟻ê法度，就是鋸好ê製品mài囥siunn久，ná鋸ná賣ê柴料直透翻新弄tín動，伊就蹛bē tiâu。顛倒講--tńg-來，若用「新--ê疊舊--ê」ê步數囤柴料，見賣--ê lóng tuì頂面搬起，m̄ bat hiau著下跤沿ê時tsūn，白蟻就ē無人請家己來，愈湠愈旺。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">白蟻蛀柴是無晝無暗、無年無節，有精差--ê是日--時有liâu柴ê機器leh tân，四箍liàn-tńg tsiânn吵，聽bē著in ê喙齒leh khè柴ê聲，啊若暝--時，工廠無人作穡，地靈khah輕ê時tsūn，tiānn-tiānn聽ē著in「si-su̍t……si-su̍t……si-su̍t……」ê聲，tī耳空邊hainn無歇，好佳哉sio連sio-suà ê聲調無kuân無低，bē吵人ê眠，我有kah意聽。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：https://reurl.cc/9nW8xj）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleuse